<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Investment Strategies', description: 'Our three uncorrelated asset classes: Physical Real Estate, Quantitative Options Hedging, and Early-Stage Venture.' }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<main class="flex-grow">
  
  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-brand-navyLight">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-navyLight border border-brand-gold/40 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold mb-4">
          <span>Three Uncorrelated Disciplines</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight mb-4">
          Built to compound across all four economic seasons.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-slateLight leading-relaxed">
          Rather than relying on continuous market liquidity or speculative valuation multiples, each of our three pillars is engineered to produce independent, defensible cash flows.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pillar 1: Physical Real Estate -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white border-b border-brand-linen">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-linen shadow-md">
            <img src="/images/pillar-realestate.png" alt="Class B/C Workforce Real Estate" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-6">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold font-bold">Pillar I</span>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-bold mt-1">Physical Real Estate</h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-slateLight font-medium mt-1">Focus: Essential Workforce Housing & Supply-Constrained Sunbelt / Midwest Corridors</p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
            We acquire existing Class B and C multifamily communities catering to working families. These properties provide resilient, non-discretionary housing demand regardless of wider economic contractions.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">50% Operating Reserve Rule</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                We never accept optimistic broker pro-formas. We model 50% of revenue for real taxes, insurance, and maintenance from day one.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Sub-Replacement Cost</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Acquisitions are strictly capped at 70–75% of reproduction basis, establishing a structural moat against new construction.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Fixed-Rate Debt Mandate</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Zero floating-rate bridge debt. All financing is locked long-term with minimum 12-month operational liquidity buffers.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">High Cash Yield Hurdle</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Properties must demonstrate a minimum 9.5% unlevered operating return upon stabilization, independent of future appreciation.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="/sheets/multifamily-matrix.html" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy hover:text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>View FM-RE-01 Diligence Matrix &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pillar 2: Quantitative Options Hedging -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-brand-cream border-b border-brand-linen">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold font-bold">Pillar II</span>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-bold mt-1">Quantitative Options & Hedging</h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-slateLight font-medium mt-1">Focus: Volatility Monetization & Asymmetric Tail-Risk Capital Preservation</p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
            Market volatility is not a hazard to avoid; it is an asset to harvest. We run an institutional derivatives engine designed to generate steady cash flow during sideways markets and capture liquidity during systemic crashes.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">0.18 Delta Systematic Call Engine</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Writing short-duration covered calls (30–45 days) against index equities to generate 10–14% annualized non-directional cash flow.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Pre-Funded Crash Insurance</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Reinvesting 20% of option income into deep out-of-the-money puts that surge +500% to +1,000% during severe financial panics.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">100% Cash-Secured Collateral</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Zero naked short puts or margin debt. All cash collateral is continuously swept into 4-week US Treasury bills earning risk-free yield.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Three-Tier Volatility Regimes</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Systematic rulebook: write tight spreads when volatility is low; expand safety buffers and monetize tail hedges when volatility spikes.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="/sheets/delta-hedging-matrix.html" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy hover:text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>View FM-MM-03 Options Matrix &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-linen shadow-md">
            <img src="/images/pillar-markets.png" alt="Quantitative Options Hedging" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pillar 3: Early-Stage Venture -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white border-b border-brand-linen">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-linen shadow-md">
            <img src="/images/pillar-venture.png" alt="Seed Stage Venture Capital" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-6">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold font-bold">Pillar III</span>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-brand-navy font-bold mt-1">Early-Stage Venture Capital</h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-slateLight font-medium mt-1">Focus: High-Velocity Founders & Capital-Efficient Software & Fintech</p>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-inkMuted leading-relaxed">
            We write first institutional checks ($250k–$750k) into technical founders building indispensable enterprise software, financial infrastructure, and applied AI. We evaluate execution velocity over pitch decks.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">72-Hour Velocity Test</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                We measure how fast founding teams iterate. Teams that push code, close customers, and solve technical hurdles within 72 hours earn our backing.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Anti-Dilution Cap Table Defense</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                We mandate that pre-Series A dilution remains under 20%. Protecting founder equity ensures long-term alignment and high motivation.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Capital Efficiency Hurdle</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                We reject cash-burning growth at any cost. We require a net burn multiple under 1.5x and minimum $180k ARR per technical employee.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-cream border border-brand-linen">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Contractual Pro-Rata Rights</h4>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-brand-inkMuted leading-normal">
                Every seed check includes full side-letter pro-rata participation rights, preserving syndicate allocation into breakout growth rounds.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <a href="/sheets/seed-safe-audit.html" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy hover:text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>View FM-VC-02 Venture Diligence Audit &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-14 bg-brand-cream text-center">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Ready to review our 20-year cross-cycle history?</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-inkMuted mb-6">See how these three pillars performed during 2008, 2020, and the 2022 rate reset.</p>
      <a href="/track-record" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-brand-navy text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-brand-navyLight transition-colors">
        <span>View 20-Year Track Record &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
